  "strategy": "Killian, Decisive Mentor taps and goads a creature whenever an enchantment you control enters, and draws a card whenever creatures wearing your Auras attack. The deck hands its Auras to the table: Coercive, Ghoulish, Martial and Parasitic Impetus and Redemption Arc goad the creature they enchant, and Scriv, the Obligator signs a Contract onto an opponent's creature. Every attack then pays someone: Ghostly Prison, Tomik, Wielder of Law and Mangara, the Diplomat tax and punish attacks aimed at you, Breena, the Demagogue and Combat Calligrapher reward attacks aimed elsewhere, and Eriette of the Charmed Apple drains each opponent for every Aura you control. Sram, Senior Edificer, Kor Spiritdancer, Pearl-Ear and Sage's Reverie turn the Auras into cards, Starfield Mystic and Transcendent Envoy make them cheaper, and Animate Dead, Screams from Within and Eiganjo Dynastorian's Replenish bring them back. Chains of Custody and Sheltered by Ghosts exile an opponent's best permanent while they ward your own creature.",
